{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12885","headline":"送王诞渤海使赴李太守行营 · 韩翃","name":"送王诞渤海使赴李太守行营","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少年结客散黄金，中岁连兵扫绿林。\n渤海名王曾折首，汉家诸将尽倾心。\n行人去指徐州近，饮马回看泗水深。\n喜见明时锺太尉，功名一似旧淮阴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12885.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12885","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}